      "query": "{\"content\": \"P(grant) 0.12. The petition raises a mature, acknowledged circuit split regarding the interpretation of \\\"willful and malicious injury\\\" under 11 U.S.C. \\u00a7 523(a)(6), specifically whether subjective belief of legal justification negates the intent to injure. The issue is well-framed in the questions presented and is of considerable practical importance to bankruptcy practitioners. \\n\\nThe docket shows the petition was distributed once, and then a response was requested on Februa",
